==================== Input ====================
/*
 * Break-point in an over-wide math-y value run: our core fill (biome semantics)
 * breaks at the last fitting SEPARATOR (before `/ 2`).
 * DIVERGES from Prettier (DIVERGENCES.md "fill-break-position"),
 * whose fill fit-check breaks INSIDE the wide chunk (after `+`).
 */
.SearchBox {
  .inner {
    margin-left: sg-layout-width(logo-shopify) / 2 * -1 + sg-offset-x(page-nav) / 2;
  }
}

